    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "タマちゃん、今度お好み焼きを\n焼くコツを教えてくれませんか？",
            "enText": "Tama, do you think you could teach me\nthe trick to your <i>okonomiyaki</i> some time?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -1118254339788881584,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "タマモクロス",
            "enName": "Tamamo Cross",
            "jpText": "おっ、なんや。アンタが\n頼み事なんて珍しいな！",
            "enText": "Oh, well there's a first. I'm usually the one\nasking <i>you</i> for help.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 6819808988454608555,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "タマちゃんのお好み焼きは\n本当に美味しくて……。",
            "enText": "But your <i>okonomiyaki</i> is just sooo <i>good…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 4405465326360905358,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "同じように作っても、\nどこか違うものですから～。",
            "enText": "No matter how many times I try,\nI can't seem to get it right.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 8892914648110878858,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "タマモクロス",
            "enName": "Tamamo Cross",
            "jpText": "フッフーン。悪い気はせぇへんし、\n教えるくらい、かまへんで！",
            "enText": "Hehe… Gotta admit, this feels good.\nAll right, I'll teach ya!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -6816635774358760689,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "タマモクロス",
            "enName": "Tamamo Cross",
            "jpText": "ウチの舌は厳しいで。\n覚悟しとき！",
            "enText": "But be warned, I'm a strict teacher!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 3048925570399148936,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "はい、ありがとうございます～。",
            "enText": "Of course. Thank you very much!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 6784287229308028762,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "上手に焼けたら、ふーふーして、\r\nあーんもしてそれから……。",
            "enText": "I'll make the perfect one, blooow on it\nto cool it down, and then feed it to you\nmyself…",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -362098895796923632,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "うふふ、タマちゃんに\n味見してもらうのが楽しみです～♪",
            "enText": "Hehe, I wonder what sort of face\nyou'll make when you taste it♪",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 8151313142501325149,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "タマモクロス",
            "enName": "Tamamo Cross",
            "jpText": "……アンタ、それが目的と\nちゃうやろな。",
            "enText": "…So that's your real aim here.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 4160327728163891862,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1780174512,
    "humanTl": true
}